      <element xsi:type="archimate:ArchimateDiagramModel" name="B02 - Aktori &lt;-&gt; Role" id="view-b02-actor-role" documentation="Prirazeni business actors na business roles (assignment). Vice aktoru muze mapovat na stejnou roli (subsystem lead).">
